{"id":"f6d2861379de331b","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kt-countable.md","title":"K 平凡集可数无穷","display":"thm-kt-countable — K 平凡集可数无穷","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kt-countable","aliases":["43-thm-kt-countable"],"display":"thm-kt-countable — K 平凡集可数无穷","depends_on":["[[43-df-ktrivial]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Thm.15.1.8; Cor.15.1.9(a), printed p.411 / PDF p.431","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kt-countable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kt-countable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kt-countable — K 平凡集可数无穷"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Thm.15.1.8; Cor.15.1.9(a), printed p.411 / PDF p.431"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}\">\\(\\mathrm{KTrivial}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a>；按固定自然数编码识别集合与序列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl|\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\}\\bigr|=\\aleph_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl|\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\}\\bigr|=\\aleph_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个固定常数 d 只有 O(2^d) 条路径，取可数个 d 的并得至多可数；所有有限集可计算，给无限多个见证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]；按固定自然数编码识别集合与序列。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KTrivial}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl|\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\}\\bigr|=\\aleph_0.","display":true}],"bytes":1003,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-366","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kt-countable]] — K 平凡集可数无穷"}],"outgoing":["ccd45302acc926e6"]}